What the licence above does not cover
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The ARQ-COMP logo, and the favicons cropped from it, are the identity of the
competition rather than reusable source. They are not covered by the licence
above, and all rights to them are reserved:

  logo/
  assets/icons/

The GitHub mark inlined as an SVG path in _layouts/default.html is GitHub's
trademark, used to label a link to the project's own GitHub organisation. Its
use is governed by GitHub's logo guidelines, not by this licence.


-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Attribution
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This site is built on the Dinky theme for GitHub Pages:

  https://github.com/pages-themes/dinky

Dinky is dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal, which asks for
no attribution. It is recorded here anyway, because the site is a genuine
derivative rather than a mere consumer of the theme: _layouts/default.html
began as a copy of Dinky's own layout, and assets/css/style.scss imports
Dinky's stylesheet and restates a number of its rules on top.

Two typefaces are loaded from Google Fonts rather than bundled in this
repository, so their files are not redistributed here. Both are under the SIL
Open Font License 1.1:

  Arvo, by Anton Koovit    -- headings, pulled in by Dinky's own stylesheet
  Inter, by Rasmus Andersson -- body copy, requested in _layouts/default.html
